abstract: >-
  Author-developed and independently maintained by Muthana Zouri and Carmen
  Marinela Cumpăt. The authors are responsible for the content, maintenance,
  and subsequent updates.
  Editable institutional records, workbooks, worked examples, reference guides,
  process maps, and reproducible analytical resources aligned with the revised
  four-part, twelve-chapter book. Evidence, Value, Governance, and Lifecycle Decision-Making.
